"A clean, well-organised PDF with proper paragraphs, headings and tables, and "
"the same in Word."
msgstr ""
"Un PDF pulito e ben organizzato, con paragrafi, titoli e tabelle ordinati, e "
"lo stesso in Word."

#: apps/docops/templates/docops/services/_tier.html:1
msgid ""
"A PDF that looks like your original: same layout, colours and logo, built "
"and checked page by page. PDF files only. Stamps and signatures are left out."
msgstr ""
"Un PDF identico all'originale: stesso layout, stessi colori e stesso logo, "
"creato e controllato pagina per pagina. Solo file PDF. Timbri e firme non "
"sono inclusi."

