msgid "The summary on the page and as Word or text."
msgstr "Il riepilogo sulla pagina e in formato Word o testo."

#: apps/docops/templates/docops/services/_tier.html:1
msgid ""
"The summary as a clean report PDF with headings and tables, and in Word."
msgstr "Il riepilogo come report PDF pulito con titoli e tabelle, e in Word."

#: apps/docops/templates/docops/services/_tier.html:1
msgid ""
"The most careful summary, every figure checked, on a designed page: PDF and "
"Word in the same design."
msgstr ""
"Il riepilogo più accurato, con ogni cifra verificata, in una pagina curata "
"nel design: PDF e Word con lo stesso design."

#: apps/docops/templates/docops/services/_tier.html:1
msgid "An editable Word file with the text, headings and tables of every page."
msgstr "Un file Word modificabile con testo, titoli e tabelle di ogni pagina."

#: apps/docops/templates/docops/services/_tier.html:1
msgid ""
"An editable Word file that looks like the original: every page rebuilt with "
"its layout. PDF files only."
msgstr ""
"Un file Word modificabile identico all'originale: ogni pagina ricostruita "
"con il suo layout. Solo file PDF."

